# Intentionally empty.
# Do NOT set `prefix` or `globalconfig` here: both are incompatible with nvm
# (nvm manages the global prefix per Node version and warns on every shell
# startup when it finds them in ~/.npmrc). Global packages go to the active
# Node's prefix instead (`npm config get prefix` when a nvm version is in use).
# The legacy ~/.npm-packages/bin PATH entry in npm/rc is kept only as a
# backward-compat shim for binaries installed before this change.
